  "query_preview": "/SATURDAY NIGHT THROUGH THURSDAY/...\nIssued at 254 PM CDT Fri Jul 31 2026\n\nPleasant and dry conditions continue on Sunday and Monday as the \nupper ridge builds eastward with temperatures in the upper 70s to \nlow 80s. Active weather then returns through mid next week as a \nlongwave trough approaches with several waves moving through the \noverarching upper level flow. This will return precipitation chances \nto our area from Tuesday night to around Thursday with the pattern \nlooking to remain active into next weekend. Temperatures don't \nreally rebound keeping conditions for early August largely nice and \nin the 80s.",
